  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "It would be great a feature to setup in a simple or advanced way to prevent users to change avatars after joining an public/friends+ instance, by time or indefinitely. This way we reduce the lag caused by downloading avatars if people start changing avatars too much. Very useful in a party, because jumping to another instance with different privacy setting, switching Safety settings, and managing Invite Only instance is a lot of work.\nIf preventing other users to change avatars is too much, make it local, something like \"See only first loaded avatars\" with an option to ByPass that individually or for Friends only in Safety.",
